    <name>South Africa FM Stations — ICASA TBFP</name>
    <description>FM broadcast footprints derived from ICASA Terrestrial Broadcasting Frequency Plan (TBFP). Coverage circles use empirical free-space formula: r = 28 × √ERP(kW), capped at 120 km. This is an approximation — actual coverage depends on terrain, antenna height and obstructions.</description>
